sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Customer (React Client)
    participant Spring as Spring Boot REST API
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    participant AI as AI Service (FastAPI - Deferred)

    Customer->>Spring: POST /api/recommendations/evaluate (Preferences, MovieId)
    Spring->>DB: Query eligible candidate shows for Movie & Date
    DB-->>Spring: Return candidate list (Prices, Times, Seat Availability)
    
    alt AI Service Available & Enabled
        Spring->>AI: POST /api/v1/recommend (Candidates + Preferences)
        AI->>AI: Apply Hard Constraints (Budget, Time, Seats)
        AI->>AI: Compute MCDM Scores (S_i = Sum(w_j * x_ij))
        AI-->>Spring: Return Ranked Shows + Score Factor Explanations
    else AI Service Disabled / Unreachable / Timeout
        Spring->>Spring: Execute Local Java Fallback Decision Engine
    end
    
    Spring-->>Customer: Return Ranked Recommendations & Alternatives
    Customer->>Spring: Select Show & Preferred Seats (POST /api/bookings/hold)
    Spring->>DB: Lock Show Seats (AVAILABLE -> HELD)
    Spring-->>Customer: Return Booking Hold Details & Timer (e.g. 10m)
